      "standardized_narrative": "At 1 January 2021 the syndicate had gross claims outstanding of GBP 1,184.6m. During 2021 the syndicate reported a net release from prior year reserves of GBP 28.1m driven by more favourable claims development than expected. This release was partially offset by adverse items in the year including COVID-19 deterioration and several named catastrophe and large loss events (for example Winter Storm Uri, Hurricane Ida and the South African Riots). The syndicate's gross reserves at 31 December 2021 were GBP 1,146.5m.",
